      "subject": "Warranty desk call script",
      "shortSummary": "A fake warranty call pressures Riley to confirm device and account details.",
      "date": "0001-01-01T00:00:00",
      "body": "Riley flagged this caller and preserved the script. Review the claimed consequence and requested information.\n\nCall script excerpt:\nYour phone warranty will be void before the expo shift unless you confirm the account holder and recovery details. Harborview cannot restore badge access if the warranty record is locked.\n\nAsha",
